attorneys.bio:
Accomplished attorney with over 25 years of experience. I have a strong background in the following fields:

1) Family law - represent interested parties in custody, visitation and child support cases and perform as a guardian ad litem for children in abuse/neglect cases and custody/visitation cases;

2) Incapacitated adults - file petitions for guardianship and conservatorship and perform duties as an adult guardian ad litem in guardianship and conservatorship hearings;

3) Estate planning - draft wills, financial and medical power of attorneys and living wills;

4) Mediation - mediate divorce, custody, visitation and child support issues; and

5) Adoption - represent adoptive parents by filing petitions and finalizing the adoption.

